@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/students

### Create Ananya Rao (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 7101,
  "studentName": "Ananya Rao",
  "email": "ananya.rao@example.com",
  "courseName": "Computer Science",
  "programmingScore": 96,
  "mathematicsScore": 90,
  "technicalSkills": [
    "Java",
    "MySQL"
  ]
}

