### List all students (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}

### Find Meera by ID (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/7103

### Merit list (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/merit-list

### Search by email (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/email?email=meera.nair@example.com

### Search by course (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/course?course=Computer%20Science

### Shared skills (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-skills

### Programming below 50 and mathematics at least 75 (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/needs-improvement

### Duplicate student ID (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 7101,
  "studentName": "Ananya Rao",
  "email": "ananya.rao@example.com",
  "courseName": "Computer Science",
  "programmingScore": 96,
  "mathematicsScore": 90,
  "technicalSkills": [
    "Java",
    "MySQL"
  ]
}

### Invalid programming score on create (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 7106,
  "studentName": "Ananya Rao",
  "email": "ananya.rao@example.com",
  "courseName": "Computer Science",
  "programmingScore": 101,
  "mathematicsScore": 90,
