}

### Invalid mathematics score on update (400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/7102
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "programmingScore": 87,
  "mathematicsScore": -1,
  "technicalSkills": [
    "Java"
  ]
}

### Update Kabir's scores and skills (200)
